{"id": "UgxcRLJBeSnaOwJTgVh4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 2, "text": "또 스피커 자랑할만하네요 가수님소리를 담길많하네요 모두가 명곡🎉🎉🎉🎉🎉🎉🎉", "published": "2026-05-09T12:17:08", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "UgyoHlNALdgkKYXrC1t4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 2, "text": "아이큐님\n마치음악한곡들은것같이생각되는군요\n몸밖에가진것이없다\n저도아파요\n음악잘듣겠습니다", "published": "2026-06-07T17:09:59", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "UgxF5L96bPoELy-PD914AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 2, "text": "자꾸 들으러 오네요 구독은 그 전에 했고", "published": "2026-05-28T15:20:15", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "UgxePHQ6B1Pzml55VtZ4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 2, "text": "잘 들었습니다", "published": "2026-05-09T13:21:57", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "UgwNzcgXHpBNMimZyK54AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 1, "text": "What is she saying? Why I am crying 😢", "published": "2026-05-15T07:25:08", "replies": 2, "creator": false}
{"id": "UgwNzcgXHpBNMimZyK54AaABAg.AWoxu-xFuNsAWpEfVbrucV", "parent": "UgwNzcgXHpBNMimZyK54AaABAg", "likes": 0, "text": "다른 사람을 사랑하며 아파하는 연인을 곁에서 지켜볼 수밖에 없는 애절하고 고통스러운 심경을 담은가사입니다", "published": "2026-05-15T10:00:26", "replies": 0, "creator": true}
{"id": "UgwNzcgXHpBNMimZyK54AaABAg.AWoxu-xFuNsAWpEmWuONNu", "parent": "UgwNzcgXHpBNMimZyK54AaABAg", "likes": 1, "text": "I’m standing in the shadows of your grief,\nWatching you cry for a heart that isn’t mine.\nEvery tear you shed for him falls like glass on my soul,\nA silent witness to a love I can’t reach.\nIt’s a ghost I’m fighting, a battle already lost,\nLoving you while you’re busy losing him.", "published": "2026-05-15T10:01:24", "replies": 0, "creator": true}
